@startuml

title RAG System Overview

' Make diagram wider
skinparam maxMessageSize 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 100
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User
participant "RAG Pipeline" as RAG
participant "Retrieval Service" as Retrieval
database "Qdrant\nVector Database" as Qdrant
participant "LLM" as LLM
participant "Structured\nOutput" as Output

User -> RAG: Extraction Question

RAG -> Retrieval: Query + Retrieval Scope
note over RAG, Retrieval
  Retrieval Scopes:
  • Specific Paper
  • Relevant Papers
  • All Papers
end note

Retrieval -> Qdrant: Hybrid Search
Qdrant --> Retrieval: Relevant Article Chunks

Retrieval -> Retrieval: Rerank Retrieved Chunks
Retrieval --> RAG: Relevant Evidence

RAG -> LLM: Question + Retrieved Evidence
LLM --> RAG: Generated Extraction

RAG -> Output: Format Structured Results
Output --> User: Answer + Supporting Evidence

@enduml